        dcterms:source "Sapala et al. (2018) eLife 7:e32794 & Bidhendi et al. (2019) Nat. Plants 5:981-992 characteristic pavement cell lobe wavelength 24.5 ± 2.8 um" ;
        schema:value "24.5" .

